WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:08.800
My phone..

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:09.700
..stopped..

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:10.800
Why,??

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.420
you're the most irrelevant person I know-

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.740
Listen......carefully..

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.400
I'm speaking code.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.860
my wife and I...

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.700
...were on a lovely Vacation...

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:26.260
I had an Important Meeting

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.600
*snores*

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.200
Where is your Sense of Adventure?

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.020
so she went out to see the local wildlife....

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:34.060
..Wow..

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.900
What is wrong with you?!

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:41.250
and met up with some....

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:42.200
...fans...

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.560
you...are Turk Henry's wife...

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.980
And now they want to meet me..

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:53.420
This Could Be Straight Forward Kidnapping

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.900
Or something more sinister like..

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.100
Terrorists..

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.300
Terrorists??

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.369
Terrorists..??!!

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:03.700
We heard some Chatter..

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:09.400
over The Homeland...NSA...meta Data Harvesting machines Up in outer Space..

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:12.720
I have had to  make the choise...

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.520
..between starving..

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:15.760
..and Freedom

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.220
When I was Modeling I had to skip me on all the time too....

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.440
I'm getting my wife back.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:23.080
and I'll bring you the head in a bag..

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:25.500
I don't want her head in a bag...

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.920
..where would i put it??

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:27.600
The fridge.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.020
*aaaahh*

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:46.500
That's what I have to deal With on a Day-To-day basis

00:01:57.409 --> 00:01:59.409
you

